<title>UK: Merrill Lynch Intl buys shares in Europe unit.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch Intl buys shares in Europe unit.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch Europe Plc said on Thursday that its parent Merrill Lynch International Holdings had bought another 97.334 million ordinary shares in it for one stg a share.</p>
<p>A Merrill spokesperson said that the fresh issue represented 11.8 percent of Merrill Lynch Europe's total issued ordinary share capital.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
